                  "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #475569;\">This run does both actions. It does not change Active Directory.</p><p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #475569;\"><strong>Remove owners</strong> from accounts named <strong>nhi.*</strong> on Microsoft Active Directory @emea-tes-team (NHI). Accounts that already have no owner are left as they are.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; color: #475569;\"><strong>Uncorrelate</strong> accounts named <strong>oam.*</strong> on Microsoft Active Directory @emea-tes-team (Users) by clearing the identity link in Identity Security Cloud.</p>",
